# Plugin Check exclusions for local and CI scans: `wp plugin check wereldkundig-for-gravity-forms --use-pcpignore`.
# Mirrors the export-ignore entries in .gitattributes, plus local files that git ignores, so the scan
# covers only what ships. Entries are anchored to the plugin root; a trailing slash means a directory.

